cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Materie prime: incoming inspection of raw materials (db, 1998–1999)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Materie prime records the incoming inspection of the raw materials delivered to a plastics plant: trade name, origin, delivery date, analysis number, lorry plate, lot, number of bags, particle size, sieving, contaminants, the checks performed, the laboratory analyses and the destination silo. The analyses can be searched by name, origin, lot, plate, silo and dispatch."
authors:
